Title: Subregular linguistics: bridging theoretical linguistics and formal grammar
Author: Thomas Graf
Date: 2026-03-15
Category: Papers
Tags: Minimalist grammars; first-order logic; formal grammar; islands; phonology; subregular; syntax

<div markdown class="authors">
Graf, Thomas
